          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:35292bbd3b35bd494b4e8f99f6b964fbebc4ef640c038781978a6fd2ac162dcd:"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "claim_1ec0a0f722d448e0b71fda5c03b01b3a",
      "statement": "`20261024110000_add_dashboard_operational_fields.sql` is recorded ❌ and only partly checked: its `batches.billing_deadline` column is live, but the column comment and the partial index `batches_tenant_billing_deadline_idx` in the same file were never checked and its own header still says NOT APPLIED — so a push tries to re-run it and its objects must be verified by name and the file recorded first.",
