      "id": "claim_bae6499d8e304162a367d6d53bf2e7f0",
      "statement": "ADR-007 was rewritten as a new additive migration after having been written as an in-place edit of `20260910120000`, because that file became recorded and editing a recorded file changes only the repository — the new file is correct whichever way the applied/unapplied question lands, since migrations run in filename order.",
