    {
      "id": "claim_4aec962175284c199f7645e8b4777595",
      "statement": "Regenerating `lib/supabase/database.types.ts` is safe only against a database already holding every object the file describes, and no such database exists: the file's own header calls it hand-maintained, it carries `billing_deadline` (live, unrecorded) and the T2MIS shapes by hand, and it holds no `excused`, no `max_absence_percent` and none of the billing-domain tables — so a regeneration today deletes the hand-carried halves.",
      "evidence": [
