    {
      "id": "claim_a72c34cfc0934476b371716d7821f1e1",
      "statement": "Mappers tolerate schema that is not there yet in two mirrored ways, and only the read side is currently guarded: `orEmpty` (`?? ''`) makes an absent `learner_details` join and a legitimate null both render as blank cells, and `row.billing_deadline ?? null` stops an absent column (which `select('*')` yields as `undefined`, slipping past every `!== null` check) reading as a recorded value — while `writeDetails` in the importer upserts `learner_details` with no absence check.",
