      "statement": "Every migration's application is deferred to a permission ask even when the file is already committed and reviewed, and the state is declared in the file's own header; `/docs/agents/issue-tracker.md` carries the same obligation into issue filing, where a research ticket needing the live project is flagged rather than auto-fired.",
