    {
      "id": "claim_6df3a9db421c4cf284a89025d7dbb021",
      "statement": "`verify_user_admin_setup.sql` restates `20260904120000`'s four policies idempotently next to a temporary role change and one shared transaction, so the uncommented `set local app.environment` aborts both parts; it also documents that `DATABASE_URL` must be the session pooler on port 5432 as `postgres.<ref>`, because the `db.<ref>.supabase.co` host publishes an AAAA record and is unreachable without IPv6.",
